{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203410","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203410","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1320341001:1":{"text":"나쁜 자식들... 감히 내 용병을 다치게 해? 이것도 다 배상받을 거야!","source_cn":"你们这群混账……居然打伤了我这么多佣兵！这可都是要赔钱的！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBB7010E8F965A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320341002:1":{"text":"동네 사람을! 이게 바로 예브게니 영감과 레프스키의 본모습이라고! 돈을 빌려놓고 갚지 않더니, 이제는 사람을 때리기까지 하다니!","source_cn":"左邻右舍都来瞧瞧，这就是老叶甫根尼和列夫斯基的行事作风...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84DCC26C9EEFD993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320341003:1":{"text":"뭐요?! 당신이 먼저 시작한 거잖아요!","source_cn":"什么啊？！明明是你先动的手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A68D3765D44A0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320341004:1":{"text":"웃기시네! 레프스키가 어떤 놈인지 알아? 혼자 온갖 고상한 척하며 입만 열면 예술 타령에, 귀족들에게 아부나 하던 녀석이지!","source_cn":"得了吧！你们说说列夫斯基这个人，从前自诩清高，满嘴都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67863B5563304931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320341005:1":{"text":"하지만 녀석이 쓰러진 뒤에 그 귀족들이 얼굴이나 내비쳤나? 돈을 빌려준 건 우리 같은 착한 사람들이었어! 하지만 그가 죽고 난 뒤에 아비인 예브게니 영감은 돈을 갚을 생각이 없나 보군!","source_cn":"他病倒之后，那些老爷可没一个过来探望的，只有我们这些好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9C8DA14FD44919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320341006:1":{"text":"내가 그랬지? 신이 벌을 내려서 병에 걸린 거라니까!","source_cn":"要我说啊，他得的病就是神明的惩罚！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F8EDCEB73991541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320341007:1":{"text":"뭐... 뭐라고?!","source_cn":"你……你瞎说什么！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16CE0900C2983E8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320341008:1":{"text":"흥, 예브게니! 어차피 이들은 곧 떠날 사람들이지. 하지만 너는 도망가지 못할 거야.","source_cn":"哼，老叶甫根尼，我劝你早点认命。这些多管闲事的人早晚要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89D1E6C450052C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320341009:1":{"text":"그러니 내 화를 돋우지 않는 게 좋을 거야. 그러지 않으면...","source_cn":"可别惹急了我，不然我真对你动——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F552962FD71202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320341010:1":{"text":"방금 \"신이 벌을 내려서 병에 걸렸다\"고 했습니까?","source_cn":"你刚才说，“生病是神明的惩罚”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA698600D74CAF22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320341011:1":{"text":"무슨 뜻인지 이해가 가지 않는군요. 설명을 부탁드리지요.","source_cn":"这句话是什么意思？我不太理解，想请你解释一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A42878255711F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320341012:1":{"text":"너, 너는... 살아있는 시체!","source_cn":"你、你你你……是活死人！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA1EA3B398D601ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320341013:1":{"text":"제 질문에 아직 대답하지 않았습니다.","source_cn":"你还没回答我的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44CB4BF267B0A2C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320341014:1":{"text":"다, 다시는 안 올게! 제발 살려줘!","source_cn":"我……我……我不会再来了！放过我吧！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1320240089F93887","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320341015:1":{"text":"쳇, 도망치는 건 빠르네요!","source_cn":"哼……跑得倒是够快的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BAB8F66B5FFC8D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:讨债的商人":{"text":"빚을 독촉하는 상인","sourc